OL,3,GNEWSAInquest jury to examine if
OL,4,Astudent's MenB death was preventable
OL,5,
OL,6,FA jury is to hear the inquest into the
OL,7,Fdeath of an 18-year-old who died from
OL,8,Fmeningitis B (MenB), and look at
OL,9,Fwhether her death was "preventable", a
OL,10,Fcoroner has ruled.
OL,12,FMegan Draper, from Pontypool, Torfaen,
OL,13,Fdied in October last year from
OL,14,Fmeningococcal type B meningitis, weeks
OL,15,Fafter starting a physiotherapy course
OL,16,Fin Bournemouth.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
