OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAInquest jury to examine if
OL,4,Astudent's MenB death was preventable
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt a hearing in Bournemouth, coroner
OL,7,FBrendan Allen said there would be a
OL,8,Fjury inquest "as a matter of law"
OL,9,Fbecause Draper died of a notifiable
OL,10,Fdisease, meaning health professionals
OL,11,Fmust inform local health teams of
OL,12,Fsuspected cases.
OL,14,FHe said the inquest would look at
OL,15,Fwhether Draper's "death was
OL,16,Fpreventable".
